Summary:
Today’s session involved starting the preparation of the project synopsis for the Multi-Vendor E-commerce Platform. The focus was on organizing the previously analyzed requirements into a structured document format. Key sections such as project objective, problem statement, proposed solution, modules, and technology stack were drafted. Effort was made to clearly present the scope and workflow of the system in a concise and understandable manner.

Outcomes:
An initial draft of the project synopsis was prepared, covering the essential details of the project. The structure and content required for submission were clearly outlined. This step ensured readiness for refining and completing the synopsis within the deadline. It also strengthened clarity on the overall project direction before moving into development phases.
